WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.950
In the middle of a fierce battle
between Chin and Gi, they meet again:

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.950
Shin and Rin Ko.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.250
Which of them will overcome his limits

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.790
and have his own way in the end?

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:53.330
Their blistering-hot emotions
are making sparks fly!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.660
Do you understand the
significance of this undertaking,

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:02.870
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit?

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.160
If you fall, the Chin army
here will be destroyed,

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:11.450
and we'll rush off to kill Mou Gou.

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:15.750
Keep on babblin'! If I take <i>you</i> down,

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.250
we win the whole central battle!

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.500
My path--

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:26.540
it's clear!

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:49.060
"In a Heartbeat"

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.870
Commander Shin!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.750
Shin!

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:02.410
You...

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.870
<i>...bastard</i> !

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.120
Uh-oh! In an unstable fight on horseback,

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.870
you <i>must</i> be able to grab on with your legs!

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.950
Otherwise,

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.290
he'll never be able to stop Rin Ko's blade!

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.870
Now to end this.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.080
Shin!

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.580
Commander!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.790
General!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.200
Rin Ko, sir!

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:22.450
And after he stopped that full-bodied blow...

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:26.620
If this turns into a
ground battle with that leg--

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.870
No... Shin...

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.250
...turned it into a ground battle on purpose.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.450
Honestly.

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.790
You have guts, I'll give you that.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.290
You saw you were at a
disadvantage on horseback,

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:55.500
so you risked a fight on the ground instead?

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:02.540
That was a good call.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:05.160
If you'd gone on like that,

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.000
the fight would've been over.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:16.250
Not that it changes my
overwhelming advantage in any way.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:23.410
I mean, can you even stand on that leg,

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:25.120
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit?

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.290
No problem!

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.790
Havin' to fight on one leg?

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.620
Me and Hyou trained plenty in that!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.000
Shin!

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:31.910
So tenacious... What <i>is</i> it,

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:35.500
this unusually strong spirit of his?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.790
What's been sustaining him all this time?

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:51.250
What's goin' on?
Somethin' happen to the main camp?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.660
I apologize, my lord,

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.450
and must ask your patience.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.950
I'll be right there.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.250
Fire!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:17.370
Keep firing! Don't let up!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:29.080
Send in reinforcements!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:36.660
Gather up all soldiers near the trap!
This is where we end it!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.040
Take him out!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:43.330
Take out Ren Pa--for good!

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.000
Where's General Ren Pa?!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.910
We must protect him, no matter what!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:01.660
It's no use--we can't move!
If we could just withstand these arrows...

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.330
All troops, go underneath!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:08.620
They've hidden under the corpses!
Bring out the spear corps!

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:23.790
Where's Ren Pa?

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:31.870
Well? Did we get Ren Pa?

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:34.750
I can't tell for sure--not like this...

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:41.700
Keep shooting till no one's moving!
That'll do the trick!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.580
Fire! Fiiire!

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:17.870
Knock every last Chin soldier off this cliff!

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:30.120
No... it can't be!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:34.410
The soldiers posted to the traps
have all been shoved off the cliff!

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:37.290
What on earth is going on?

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:40.290
How did Ren Pa wind up on the clifftop?

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:44.700
He was stuck in that trap, attacked by arrows!

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.870
No, he wasn't.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:55.660
We saw enemy flags in the trap
and just assumed Ren Pa was there.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:58.000
But there may have been blind spots

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:02.160
along the path to the trap as we saw it.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.410
Ren Pa divided his troops into two

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:12.750
and led his half down a different path.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.330
And then,

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:20.660
just before reaching the trap,
he headed for the top.

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:25.870
Ren Pa has even figured out
this fortress's ace in the hole.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.200
My scheme

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.540
has failed!

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.370
Well done, my lord.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.450
I had my doubts.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:53.370
Once I saw the fortress maze,
I figured it'd come into play somehow.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:58.700
But to reshape routes and trap
your foe after he'd entered your maze,

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:01.160
you need an eye for predicting
your enemies' movements

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:06.910
and a precise military eye to judge
when to put your men into motion.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.790
I wasn't sure that mediocre Mou Gou

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:18.910
would really put such a
bothersome plan into action,

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:22.290
but just in case, I came up
with a way to deal with spots

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.330
that were likely to be traps.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:28.500
You see how that turned out!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.160
Mou Gou... He used his grudge
against me for all those defeats

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:37.250
and did some careful preparation indeed...

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:42.410
This truly is a fine fortress.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:44.700
However...

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:51.950
it'll take far more than forty years
of planning to get one over on me,

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.000
Mou Gou!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.500
Ren Pa is advancing!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.750
It can't be! How is it that simple?!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:18.750
He may have escaped the trap,
but he should be still stuck in the maze!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:23.540
Here, too, he's used my strategy against me.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:28.120
In shifting the maze
to lure Ren Pa into a trap,

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:32.290
several other paths came to lead right to us.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:37.620
Furthermore, focusing our
manpower around the traps

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:40.660
to be able to strike the enemy in one fell swoop

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:43.950
left us with some poorly defended areas.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.330
Most likely

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.750
that's where Ren Pa is headed!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:58.120
I'm on my way up to see you, Mou Gou...

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:04.620
Can't leave Rin Ko waiting, after all!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:09.970
"Mou Gou"

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:43.750
There's no stopping him...
He's already almost here!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:44.410
My lord!

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.290
Ren Pa is coming!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:50.080
Don't fret... he's only <i>almost</i> here.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:54.370
Still plenty of mountain
between him and the top.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:01.660
There's no maze or the like this high up.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:04.450
All we can do is go back to basics:
put together a garrison unit

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:07.330
and get down to defending.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:13.120
With no tricks in his way,
Ren Pa will be forced to take us on.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:18.700
He has no choice but to take out
every last garrison on his way up.

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.790
But, my lord... even so...

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:26.080
With Ren Pa's momentum, it's only
a matter of time before he arrives!

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.910
A matter of time, is it?

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:35.450
Excellent!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:42.500
That right there is the
Mou Gou army's fighting style!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.830
Think it over calmly, now:

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:49.500
This Mou Gou army consists of three armies

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:53.000
led by me and my two lieutenants.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:57.910
Each division has a clear and simple role.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:03.870
Our main army defends, keeping me,
the general, from being killed.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:09.910
Meanwhile, one of the lieutenants'
armies goes after the enemy general.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:15.200
That's the strategy I've always
used to lead us to victory!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:19.620
But Ou Sen is holed up
in the rear fortress,

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:23.620
and Kan Ki is still nowhere to be found!

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:27.330
If we, his allies, have lost sight of Kan Ki,

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:31.410
then so too have our enemies.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.410
No...!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:40.370
My battle lies in trusting that
"No" and keeping it alive!

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:02.750
Ban You! Go help out the right squadron!

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:05.120
The enemy will destroy them at this rate!

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:07.080
But, sir--

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:09.750
I'll handle things here! Hurry!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:10.910
Yes, sir!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.750
They must have put their
best soldiers in this squad

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.660
to make sure we're not
focused solely on Rin Ko...

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.450
But the Gi army is unusually powerful today.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:42.830
Not a single one of you rotten
Chin invaders is gettin' out alive!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:47.750
I know what it's like,
fighting a battle you just can't lose.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.500
No, there's no leaving
our post in these conditions.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.330
Please... hang in there, Shin!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:01.830
No! He can't take any more!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.160
Let's go help Shin!

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.500
Wait!

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.410
Lieutenant So Sui!

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:11.870
If we step in here,

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:14.870
that means Shin needed his men to help him

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:18.040
out of a bad spot in single combat...

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:21.450
And with Shin aiming to be
one of the world's greatest generals,

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.950
that disgrace will haunt him
for the rest of his life!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:28.200
But none of that matters
if he dies here and now!

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.750
He won't!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:34.450
Our commander... will <i>not</i> die!

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.200
En...

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.750
Just one second...

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.200
That's all I need.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.410
Once Rin Ko gives me an opening,

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:13.370
I can take him down

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:14.910
in a heartbeat!

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.370
I know all too well...

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:36.370
I understand how crucial
single combat can be for a general.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:43.450
But right now, we're dealing with
something even more important!

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:48.040
Forgive us, Rin Ko, sir!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.660
Gi Ryou!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.700
I would understand
if you cut me down after this.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:56.450
But we cannot lose...

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:57.870
...no matter what!

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:04.040
That brat's eyes are far from dead.
This one's...

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.950
...dangerous!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.910
Shin!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:20.290
Out of my way, Chin dog!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:37.950
It happened in the blink of an eye.

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.540
Whether it was

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:58.330
an irrepressible impulse now that
Kaku Bi's revenge was within sight

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:03.700
or So Sui's instinct for self-defense,

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:09.500
the fierce desire to kill that
instantly welled up in So Sui

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.660
was turned upon Rin Ko.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.000
Rin Ko

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.290
dealt a countering blow,

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:24.000
and in the split second his attention
was turned from himself...

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:44.830
It... it worked!

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:56.450
I-It can't be... Rin Ko?!

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:57.830
Shin!

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.000
Lieutenant So Sui!

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:09.660
He's still hanging on!

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:12.040
Are you all right, Shin?!

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:15.620
Settle down... those are his death throes.

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:21.120
He won't be gettin' up again.

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:22.450
No way in hell he could...

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:24.580
...get... up...

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:37.410
He's standing--with that wound!

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:40.200
He really <i>is</i>

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:41.410
a monster!

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:52.540
Rin Ko... you bastard...

00:22:52.540 --> 00:22:57.500
My lord... is waiting.

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:02.080
I can't... lose here...

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:38.870
<i>Who will I be when we</i>
<i>meet after all these days?</i>

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:49.950
<i>Though I hesitate, even fumble,</i>
<i>I keep an eye on my someday dream</i>

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:59.700
<i>Gathering feathers won't let me fly</i>

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:04.700
<i>But whenever I find what isn't here</i>

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:10.330
<i>You're always where I'm searching</i>

00:24:10.330 --> 00:24:15.580
<i>I'll piece together these tattered wishes</i>

00:24:15.580 --> 00:24:20.790
<i>And come tell them to you</i>

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:25.950
<i>Alone, I picture my burning feelings</i>

00:24:25.950 --> 00:24:31.080
<i>As they overflow</i>

00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:36.330
<i>I'll piece together these tattered wishes</i>

00:24:36.330 --> 00:24:40.580
<i>And come tell them to you</i>

00:24:40.580 --> 00:24:43.830
<i>So we'll make it in time</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.050
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"A Good Friend"
